review:
Don't look any further: This IS the RISK game you have been looking for all along!

- It is not called RISK; 
- It doesn't have the top graphics quality or fancy UI's of most modern games; 
- And most probably you don't have any friends who will want to play this with you anymore; 

But this IS the RISK game we all have a strong craving for, once in a while!

And on the plus (+) side: There are at least 1,000 different maps (no kidding!) AND contrary to most modern and fancier-looking games, the AI here IS actually smart and somewhat hard to beat! That alone is a feat that shall be rewarded with a purchase and a try!

And I am talking about the 'medium' difficulty settings. If you want to turn your life into a stressful hell (or prove you are the greatest Emperor to have ever lived), you can set it up on even harder settings. In fact, you can even totally customize each AI's 'personality', from total berserk attackers to annoying stay at home defenders...which will make you believe you have real friends each time.

Yes, battles are RGN's, and luck plays a role in the outcome. But has anyone told you this was: RISK ?! ;)

So if you simply are a fan of board games in general, or just a bit nostalgic of the good ol' RISK game: This is an absolute must-buy!
